/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 48 0 R
/T (Derivatives and Structured Products: Financial engineers can build  SDR-denominated instruments using CXDR. For example, FX forwards, futures, or  options on CXDR would effectively hedge a basket of currencies. Tokenized bonds or  loans denominated in SDR could be issued on-chain, using CXDR as the underlying  currency. Because the SDR is an IMF unit, such products may attract institutional  interest. )
/E (Derivatives and Structured Products: Financial engineers can build  SDR-denominated instruments using CXDR. For example, FX forwards, futures, or  options on CXDR would effectively hedge a basket of currencies. Tokenized bonds or  loans denominated in SDR could be issued on-chain, using CXDR as the underlying  currency. Because the SDR is an IMF unit, such products may attract institutional  interest. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
