/Title (Token Distribution and Onboarding  CXDR has a dynamic supply: tokens are minted on demand when authorized users deposit fiat, and burned upon redemption. There is no fixed maximum cap. Minting and burning are permissioned flows involving KYC/AML. For instance:)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 342 0 R
/Next 320 0 R
>>
