/Title (contracts, wallets, and payment apps. It functions just like other stablecoins \(pegged  1:1 to a reference value\) but with built-in diversification. Consumers in high-inflation  countries might prefer receiving salaries or paying bills in CXDR rather than a single  fiat currency.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 350 0 R
/Next 346 0 R
>>
